      "mergeID": "6807a32df83e85c2ef7a25c2",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The camera position for the master's camera desyncs or anchors to spawn for late joiners.\n\nSteps:\n\n1. User 1 should create a new instance, and be the first to join the instance\n\n2. User 1 should pull out camera. In this case, it was the streamer camera. Not sure if the regular camera does this. Do not anchor the camera.\n\n3. Move away from spawn with your camera.\n\n3. User 2 should join the instance. User 1's camera position appears to be anchored at spawn, or not anywhere near User 1.\n\nWorlds I've seen this happen (all in the row, by the same user):\n\n-Ghost Police Office\n\n-Magic Freeze Tag\n\n-Infected Reborn",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1622] [Bug] Instance Master camera position desyncs",
